    slug: 'lawn-chemical-application-software-complete-guide',
    title: 'Lawn Chemical Application Software: The Complete Guide for Licensed Applicators',
    description: 'A complete guide to choosing and using lawn chemical application software, covering records, compliance, scheduling, billing, and the field tools licensed applicators rely on every day.',
